MAIN
MOVE TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 14 HALLOCATE TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 8
MOVE TEMP 16 HALLOCATE TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 A_ved_foo
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 A_ved_bar
HSTORE TEMP 1 4 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 2
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 20
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 0
MOVE TEMP 21 CALL TEMP 4 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 2 )
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 21
PRINT TEMP 5
END
A_ved_foo [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 22 4
MOVE TEMP 23 HALLOCATE TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 4
MOVE TEMP 25 HALLOCATE TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 26 TEMP 5
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 27 B_ved_getLambda
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 27
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
MOVE TEMP 28 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 4 )
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 29 0
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 29
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 3 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
MOVE TEMP 30 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 3 TEMP 9 )
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 12

RETURN TEMP 2
END
A_ved_bar [ 2 ]
BEGIN
CJUMP TEMP 1 L1
MOVE TEMP 31 1
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 3
JUMP L2
L1  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 32 10
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 4
L2  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 2
END
B_ved_getLambda [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 33 3
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 34 4
MOVE TEMP 35 3
MOVE TEMP 36 TIMES TEMP 34 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 37 HALLOCATE TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 37
MOVE TEMP 38 4
MOVE TEMP 39 HALLOCATE TEMP 38
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 39
MOVE TEMP 40 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 40
MOVE TEMP 41 Lambda_ved_1
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 41
MOVE TEMP 42 TEMP 0
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 TEMP 42
MOVE TEMP 43 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 3 8 TEMP 43

RETURN TEMP 3
END
Lambda_ved_1 [ 2 ]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 8
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 44 4
MOVE TEMP 45 HALLOCATE TEMP 44
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 45
MOVE TEMP 46 8
MOVE TEMP 47 HALLOCATE TEMP 46
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 47
MOVE TEMP 48 TEMP 5
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 48
MOVE TEMP 49 A_ved_foo
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 49
MOVE TEMP 50 A_ved_bar
HSTORE TEMP 5 4 TEMP 50
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 4
MOVE TEMP 51 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 4 TEMP 1 )
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 51
MOVE TEMP 52 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 52

RETURN TEMP 9
END

